{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Streams","html":"<article id='sn1.27'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Saṁyutta Nikāya 1.27 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Linked Discourses 1.27 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>3. Sattivagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>3. A Sword </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Sarasutta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Streams </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Kuto sarā nivattanti, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>“From where do streams recoil? </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>kattha vaṭṭaṁ na vattati; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Where does the cycle spin no more? </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Kattha nāmañca rūpañca, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Where does name and form </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>asesaṁ uparujjhatī”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>cease with no residue left behind?” </span></span></p>\n<p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Yattha āpo ca pathavī, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>“Where water and earth, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>tejo vāyo na gādhati; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>fire and air have no footing—</span></span></p>\n<p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Ato sarā nivattanti, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>from here the streams recoil; </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>ettha vaṭṭaṁ na vattati; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>here the cycle spins no more; </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Ettha nāmañca rūpañca, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>here name and form </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>asesaṁ uparujjhatī”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>cease with no residue left behind.” </span></span></p></blockquote></article>"}
